  <item>
    <title>Vol.03 爱具体的生活，也爱这个世界</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/629f1d8db32f552f54730d5b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">629f1d8db32f552f54730d5b</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Jun 2022 09:42:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期内容】</span></p><span></span><p><span>此刻我们站在人生的十字路口，也站在世界的十字路口。世界的转折点也许已经发生，未来如何我们都不知道。面对过量的信息和负面新闻，怎么处理自己的情绪？本期聊一聊面对不稳定的大环境，作为个体的我们如何自处。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Jasmine、阿U、小明</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期重点】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">1:10</a> 世界给我们带来了什么样的不确定性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">5:08</a> 信息过载产生的心理影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="367">6:07</a> 灾难发生时，精神伤害往往容易被忽视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="491">8:11</a> 如何自我消化情绪压力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 要爱具体的人，要爱生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="886">14:46</a> live in between: 海外留学生同时经历的两种视角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 正面迎击负面信息以获取对世界的相对把控感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 时代的大事离我们并不遥远</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1382">23:02</a> 留学生回国有多难？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1562">26:02</a> 用最适合自己的方式来处理外部负面信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 找到舒适区不是躺平</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期书单】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《卡拉马佐夫兄弟》-- 陀思妥耶夫斯基</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>It's Dark, It's Cold, It's Winter -- sleepmakeswaves</span></p><span></span><p><span>60km/h -- 晨曦光廊</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期制作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小明</span></p>]]></description>
